678 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 385 0 R
/E (The good news of the Gospel is not merely that our sins can be forgiven. It is that our identity can be restored. Through Jesus Christ we are invited into a new relationship with God.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
679 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 385 0 R
/T (Scripture declares: "Therefore, if anyone is in Christ, he is a new creation; the old has passed away; behold, the new has come." \( 2 Corinthians 5:17\))
/E (Scripture declares: "Therefore, if anyone is in Christ, he is a new creation; the old has passed away; behold, the new has come." \( 2 Corinthians 5:17\))
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
680 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 385 0 R
/E (Our past no longer defines us. Our failures no longer define us. Our achievements no longer define us. Christ defines us. In Him we become children of God, loved by the Father and called to reflect His character in the world.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
